{UTF-8}
Persistent Pollution= INTEG (
	Pollution Appearance-Pollution Assimilation,
		25)
	~	Pollution units (millions)
	~	World3-03's persistent pollution sector (Meadows, Randers and Meadows 2004), in its linear regime: below the 1970 level, where World3's assimilation half-life multiplier (AHLM) is 1. Written for SD Lab from the published equations; generation is an outside driver.
	|
Pollution Appearance=
	DELAY3(Pollution Generation, Transmission Delay)
	~	Pollution units (millions)/Year
	~	PPAPR = DELAY3(PPGR, PPTD).
	|
Pollution Assimilation=
	Persistent Pollution/(1.4*Assimilation Half Life 1970)
	~	Pollution units (millions)/Year
	~	PPASR = PPOL / (1.4 x AHL), AHL = AHL70 x AHLM with AHLM = 1.
	|
Pollution Generation=
	30+15*SIN(2*3.14159265358979*Time/80)+10*STEP(1, 60)
	~	Pollution units (millions)/Year
	~	An outside driver standing in for World3's generation (industry and agriculture).
	|
Transmission Delay=
	20
	~	Year
	~	PPTD
	|
Assimilation Half Life 1970=
	1.5
	~	Year
	~	AHL70
	|
********************************************************
	.Control
********************************************************~
		Simulation Control Parameters
	|
FINAL TIME  = 200
	~	Year
	~		|
INITIAL TIME  = 0
	~	Year
	~		|
SAVEPER  = 
        TIME STEP
	~	Year
	~		|
TIME STEP  = 0.5
	~	Year
	~		|
